"<td>The milliseconds without leading zeroes (0 to 999).</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr valign=\"top\">"
"<td>zz</td>"
"<td>The milliseconds with leading zeroes (000 to 999).</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr valign=\"top\">"
"<td>AP or A</td>"
"<td>Interpret as an AM/PM time. AP must be either 'AM' or 'PM'.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr valign=\"top\">"
"<td>ap or a</td>"
"<td>Interpret as an AM/PM time. ap must be either 'am' or 'pm'.</td>"
"</tr>"
"</table>"
"</body></html>"
